logy i. 192 f. SACook Ency. Bib. under the word ), either loose garment like sack, or piece of similar material (of rough, dark hair), fastened round body: put ( שִׂים ) on loins Gen 37:34 (J), 1Kin 20:31 , on (bare) flesh 21:27 ; 2Kin 6:30 , compare Jer 48:37 ; Job 16:15 (with תָּפַר ); שׂ עַלכָּֿלמָֿתְנַיִם ׳וְהַעֲלֵיתִי Amos 8:10 ; usually girt on ( חָגַר ) 2Sam 3:31 ; Isa 15:3 ; 22:12 ; Jer 4:8 ; 6:26 ; 49:3 ; Ezek 7:18 ; 27:31 ; 1Kin 20:32 ; Joel 1:8 , compare Isa 3:24 ; בַּשּׂ ׳כִּסָּה 2Kin 19:1-2 ,= Isa 37:1-2 , Jonah 3:6 , 8 ; 1Chr 21:16 , figurative of heavens (compare קָדַר ), ׳שׂ כְּסוּתָם אָשִׂים Isa 50:3 ; late שׂ ׳לָבַשׁ put on sackcloth Jonah 3:5 ; Est 4:1 , compare 4:2 ; Psa 35:13 ; 69:12 ; וְשׂ ׳בְּצוֺם Neh 9:1 , compare Dan 9:3 ; שׂ ׳מִּתַּח loosen sackcloth Isa 20:2 (+ מֵעַל ), Psa 30:12 (opposed to שִׂמְחָה ), שׂ ׳הֵסִיר מֵעַל Est 4:4 . b. same garment (or material) spread out (to lie on), 2Sam 21:10 (with הִטָּה ), Isa 58:5 (with הִצִּיעַ ), compare Est 4:3 בַּשׂ ׳וַיִּשְׁכַּב 1Kin 21:27 , בַּשּׂ ׳לִינוּ Joel 1:13 .","rootNote":"from 8264 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 21 16","keyReferences":["1Chr 21 16","1Kgs 20 31","1Kgs 20 32","1Kgs 21 27","1Kgs 21 27","2Kgs 6 30","2Kgs 19 1","2Kgs 19 2"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":48,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 21 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":21,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/שַּׂקִּ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 20 31","book":"1Kgs","chapter":20,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שַׂקִּ֨ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 20 32","book":"1Kgs","chapter":20,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שַׂקִּ֨ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 21 27","book":"1Kgs","chapter":21,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שַׂ֥ק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 21 27","book"